# Sabina Cosmetic App

Sabina Cosmetic App is an Android beauty shopping application built using **Kotlin** and **Jetpack Compose**.

The application allows users to browse Korean cosmetic products, search products, view detailed product information, and manage a persistent shopping cart with a modern and responsive UI.

This project is being developed as a **modern Android architecture practice project**, focusing on real-world e-commerce app structure.

---

# Features

## Product Browsing
- Browse Korean cosmetic products
- Flash sale section
- Category browsing
- Promotional banner slider

## Product Detail
- Product image preview
- Brand and category information
- Discount price calculation
- Product rating and review count
- Add to cart button

## Search System
- Product search by keyword
- Recent search suggestions
- Popular keyword suggestions
- Live search results

## Cart System
- Add product to cart
- Increase / decrease quantity
- Remove individual item
- Clear all cart items
- Subtotal and total calculation
- Checkout section UI
- Cart badge synchronization
- Empty cart state

## Persistent Cart (Room Database)
- Cart items are stored locally using **Room**
- Cart state persists even after app restart
- Database-backed cart system

---

# Architecture

The project follows **MVVM architecture** with clear separation of concerns.

UI Layer
Jetpack Compose screens and state observation

ViewModel Layer
Handles UI state and business logic

Repository Layer
Manages data flow between UI and database

Data Layer
Room Database for persistent cart storage

---

# Tech Stack

- Kotlin
- Jetpack Compose
- Material 3
- MVVM Architecture
- StateFlow / Flow
- Navigation Compose
- Room Database
- Repository Pattern

